  <!-- EN: <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_faction_leaderTitle] [asker_nameFull] of [asker_faction_name] needs extra hands to help [dutyDescription].\n\n[asker_pronoun] is asking you to lend [asker_objective] [colonistCountToLend] for [lendForDays] days.\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>

